protognome (1.0.10+3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix GE-Proton installation status detection for versions with architecture suffixes (e.g. GE-Proton11-5-x86_64).
  * Fix tool removal to resolve actual folder name on disk via SteamService.findInstalledToolDir prior to deletion.
  * Add unit tests for SteamService installation matching and directory resolution.
  * Auto-increment version string to 1.0.10+3 (CP-AutoIncrement).

